      "lines": [
        "Typical Transformer Block: Stacked Repeatedly",
        "Vaswani et al. Attention Is All You Need. Neurips 2017",
        "Why include residual connections",
        "and layer normalization?",
        "- Improves gradients and",
        "stabilizes learning",
        "- Enables ignoring effects of extra",
        "attention and feedforward steps",
        "(residual connections)",
        "Group discussion: all",
        "communicate, revising their",
        "views based on others",
        "Private reflection: each input",
        "updates its views without",
        "communication, using a",
        "position-wise fully connected",
        "layer applied to each separately"
      ]
    },
