      "lines": [
        "Multi-Head Attention",
        "1) Multiple self-attention",
        "mechanisms, each with",
        "query, key, and value matrices",
        "2) Compute new",
        "representations",
        "3) Concatenate new representations (z_i)",
        "and multiply with weight matrix (w_o) to",
        "create a vector size expected by the FF layer",
